<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Ordine {{ ordine.order_number }}</title>
    <style>
        @page { margin-top: 175px; margin-bottom: 40px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; color: #1f2937; margin: 0; }

        header { position: fixed; top: -148px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 145px; }
        .hdr-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .hdr-logo-cell { width: 35%; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 8px; }
        .hdr-logo-cell img { width: 190px; }
        .hdr-info-cell { width: 65%; vertical-align: middle; text-align: right; font-size: 10px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; padding-bottom: 8px; }
        .hdr-info-cell strong { font-size: 12px; color: #1e3a5f; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .hdr-divider { height: 3px; background-color: #1e3a5f; }
        .hdr-band { background-color: #1e3a5f; padding: 7px 14px; }
        .hdr-band-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .hdr-order-num { font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; }
        .hdr-date-badge { font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); padding: 3px 10px; }

        footer { position: fixed; bottom: -90px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 90px; border-top: 2px solid #1e3a5f; padding-top: 8px; }
        .ftr-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .ftr-logo-cell { width: 40%; vertical-align: middle; }
        .ftr-logo-cell img { width: 130px; }
        .ftr-sign-cell { width: 60%; text-align: right; vertical-align: bottom; font-size: 9px; color: #9ca3af; padding-bottom: 4px; }

        .content { margin-top: 8px; }

        .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        .info-left { width: 48%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 12px; }
        .info-right { width: 52%; vertical-align: top; }
        .label-sm { font-size: 9px; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .val-md { font-size: 11px; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .recipient-box { border: 1.5px solid #1e3a5f; padding: 9px 11px; }
        .recipient-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3a5f; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .recipient-meta { font-size: 9px; color: #6b7280; }

        .descr-box {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; background: #f9fafb;
            padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 14px;
            page-break-inside: auto;
        }
        .descr-title {
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3a5f;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 8px;
            page-break-after: avoid;
        }
        .descr-body {
            font-size: 10px; color: #1f2937;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-wrap: break-word;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
            line-height: 1.55;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            page-break-inside: auto;
        }

        .totals-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
        .totals-table td { padding: 7px 10px; }
        .totals-table .lbl { font-size: 10px; color: #4b5563; text-align: right; }
        .totals-table .val { font-size: 11px; color: #1f2937; text-align: right; width: 100px; }
        .totals-table tr.grand-total td { background-color: #1e3a5f; color: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; padding: 8px 10px; }

        .note-box { margin-top: 16px; padding: 9px 11px; background: #fffbeb; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; font-size: 10px; color: #78350f; }
        .accept-note { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 9px; color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px dashed #d1d5db; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <table class="hdr-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="hdr-logo-cell">
                {% if logoTopSrc %}<img src="{{ logoTopSrc }}" alt="Consorzio">{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="hdr-info-cell">
                <strong>CS Montaggi</strong>
                Via Bruno Tosarelli, 322 — 40055 Villanova di Castenaso (BO)<br>
                P.IVA 03584711208<br>
                info@csmontaggi.it
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <div class="hdr-divider"></div>
    <div class="hdr-band">
        <table class="hdr-band-table">
            <tr>
                <td><span class="hdr-order-num">Ordine Azienda &mdash; {{ ordine.order_number }}</span></td>
                <td style="text-align:right;"><span class="hdr-date-badge">{{ ordine.order_date|date('d/m/Y') }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
</header>

<footer>
    <table class="ftr-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="ftr-logo-cell">
                {% if logoBottomSrc %}<img src="{{ logoBottomSrc }}" alt="CSM">{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="ftr-sign-cell">Documento generato automaticamente da BOB · {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</footer>

<div class="content">

    <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="info-left">
                <div class="label-sm">Data ordine</div>
                <div class="val-md"><strong>{{ ordine.order_date|date('d/m/Y') }}</strong></div>
                <div class="label-sm">Periodo di riferimento</div>
                <div class="val-md">{{ periodLabel }}</div>
            </td>
            <td class="info-right">
                <div class="label-sm">Destinatario</div>
                <div class="recipient-box">
                    <div class="recipient-name">{{ ordine.azienda_name }}</div>
                    {% if ordine.azienda_codice %}
                        <div class="recipient-meta">Codice: {{ ordine.azienda_codice }}</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="descr-box">
        <div class="descr-title">Descrizione attività &mdash; cantieri del periodo</div>
        <div class="descr-body">{{ ordine.descrizione ?: '—' }}</div>
    </div>

    <table class="totals-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">Imponibile</td>
            <td class="val">€ {{ imponibileFmt }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="lbl">IVA {{ ivaPerc|number_format(0, ',', '.') }}%</td>
            <td class="val">€ {{ ivaFmt }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="grand-total">
            <td class="lbl" style="color:#fff; text-align:left;">Totale documento</td>
            <td class="val" style="color:#fff;">€ {{ totaleDocFmt }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    {% if ordine.note %}
    <div class="note-box">
        <strong>Note:</strong><br>
        {{ ordine.note|nl2br }}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="accept-note">
        Decorsi 2 giorni dal ricevimento del presente senza obiezioni o richieste, l'ordine si intende accettato in ogni sua parte.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
